@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title AFTER MVP — Proposed — Message and send knowledge: distinct dimensions
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "Local draft" as Draft
state "Reviewed immutable intent" as Reviewed
state "Dispatch pending" as Pending
state "Provider accepted (not delivered)" as Accepted
state "Rejected with evidence" as Rejected
state "Unknown / partial observation" as Unknown
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Reviewed : explicit review exact version
Reviewed --> Draft : content / recipient / attachment changes
Reviewed --> Pending : deliberate current eligible send
Pending --> Accepted : attributable acceptance
Pending --> Rejected : actual rejection evidence
Pending --> Unknown : effect observation insufficient
Unknown --> Accepted : actual reconciliation evidence
Unknown --> Rejected : authoritative no-effect rejection
note right of Accepted
 Delivered / read are independent evidence fields,
 not automatic next states or guaranteed capabilities.
 A local read observation is not recipient read.
end note

@enduml
